#: Game/Doc.lean:16
msgid "§0 fills in the goal with the expression §1, leaving every §2\n"
"inside §3 as a new goal.\n"
"\n"
"In this game its main job is handing the interpreter its fuel:\n"
"§4 turns the claim “*some* amount of fuel makes this Python\n"
"call return that value” into the concrete claim “fuel §5 does”. Extra fuel\n"
"is always harmless — a finished run keeps its result."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `rfl`
