#. §2: `refine ⟨100, ?_⟩`
#. §3: `callFunction …`
#. §4: `rfl`
#: Game/Doc.lean:25
msgid "§0 proves a goal of the form §1 when both sides compute to the\n"
"same value.\n"
"\n"
"Here that computation is a *Python run*: the goal after §2 is\n"
"an equation about §3, which is an executable Lean definition —\n"
"the verified interpreter. §4 makes Lean's kernel actually run the program\n"
"and check the output. No test framework, no mocking: the run happens inside\n"
"the proof."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `py_prove [prog]`
