#: Game/Doc.lean:59
msgid "§0 is the framework's symbolic-execution workhorse: §1\n"
"armed with the interpreter's equations. Passing the loaded program constant\n"
"(e.g. §2) unfolds the Python AST; passing §3 starts the\n"
"call; passing hypotheses (e.g. a §4 fact §5) resolves the\n"
"branch tests the symbolic input leaves open.\n"
"\n"
"§6 uses it internally — you reach for §7 yourself when a body's\n"
"shape falls outside §8's recipe."
msgstr ""

