msgid "§0 splits the proof into two: one goal with §1, one\n"
"with §2.\n"
"\n"
"The house pattern for multi-§3 Python bodies: decide every test up front\n"
"(§4), then hand the case facts to\n"
"§5 so each of the four symbolic executions runs straight through."
msgstr ""

