#: Game/Doc.lean:77
msgid "§0 is core Lean's general-purpose finisher: congruence closure plus\n"
"e-matching over your hypotheses.\n"
"\n"
"Why not §1 here? With binders at §2 (a brand for §3), comparisons\n"
"introduced by §4 elaborate brand-headed, and §5 skips any\n"
"comparison whose head type is the brand. §6 matches up to reducible\n"
"unfolding, so it sees through the brand and closes the arithmetic."
msgstr ""

